=== 003 schema
--- text
fn f (c: Text) -> I64 = match c | x if x == "a" -> 1
--- expect
refuse
--- errors
a match on Text does not cover every value: literal patterns never cover a scalar, so end it with `_` or a binder
--- phase
check
